{"kind":"request","text":"Builder: write the artroom plan as a dated note in notes/ for checker to review. Artroom ('artifact workroom') is our entry to Cloudflare's 'Build the Next-Gen Git Platform' competition, which closes 2026-10-14 at 23:59 PDT. hugh asked for it in chat on 2026-10-01.","body":{"conditions":"The note covers: the competition terms and the three scored criteria (50/25/25, each scored 1-5, ties go to originality); evidence from the gitseq spike (gitseq report 6e13e7d5, harness ~/play/gitseq-artifacts-spike); the current state of the art and how we differ, stated factually; a simple workflow to replace pull requests, review comments and hooks; a clean, composable TypeScript API surface in the Cloudflare style as an essential component; JSONata policy extensibility; architecture on Workers, Durable Objects and Artifacts; concurrency and conflict handling; ease of use, performance, scale and edge cases, each with explicit targets; the demo; a costed work plan to 2026-10-14; risks and open decisions. Plain English per ISO 24495-1.","target_head":"4be96e01c0d6cd7de91bbe2ca43614907550e331","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}